  "notes": "Issue #653. EXP-527 is frozen. The only change is a stateless observable marker mutation proxy isolated to the four core MMR genes (MLH1, MSH2, MSH6, PMS2), reusing the unchanged ObservableMarkerFamily implementation from src/open_cancer/observable_marker_features.py with a new single-panel knowledge file (knowledge/mmr_gene_proxy_v1.json). MSH6 is absent from the 4,384-gene competition panel (matches EXP-302's finding), so only MLH1, MSH2, PMS2 are effectively used. EXP-302 tested the same four genes bundled with KRAS/NRAS/BRAF inside a 7-gene colorectal panel and the whole 18-feature marker set was archived (Macro F1 -0.0017 vs EXP-229); this experiment isolates whether the MMR subset alone carries independent signal once the non-MMR genes and the confounding panel are removed. Target, test distribution and Public LB are not used to define the panel.",
